of their Queens, pledged to protect the nature and the whole living from hoggish worms at any cost.  After losing the great battle, bugs and their queens are captured, tortured, and enslaved. Many years later, bugs create a secret alliance, called \u201cRequiem Society\u201d, with the mission to unite all of the brave and mighty Bug warriors across the continent and fight back for the Volucris and the Queens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------*******-------------*******-------------*******-------------*******------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/1874603af004629a66387f1df3ef6007.poster.avif?t=1757605781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/1874603af004629a66387f1df3ef6007.webm?t=1757605781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/1874603af004629a66387f1df3ef6007.mp4?t=1757605781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/82f2075028d5b362e4ba4e5ed37a0f08.poster.avif?t=1757605781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/82f2075028d5b362e4ba4e5ed37a0f08.webm?t=1757605781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/82f2075028d5b362e4ba4e5ed37a0f08.mp4?t=1757605781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_parag